  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the char-grill to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Soak the bamboo skewers in water for 30 minutes.",
    "Mix the myeongnan-roe, lemon juice, olive oil, garlic, ginger, yellow citrus zest, salt, and black pepper in a bowl.",
    "Thread the myeongnan-roe mixture onto the bamboo skewers.",
    "Brush the skewers with olive oil and season with salt and black pepper.",
    "Char-grill the skewers for 10 minutes, flipping occasionally.",
    "Serve the skewers hot, garnished with lemon wedges and yellow citrus zest.",
    "Garnish with fresh parsley or cilantro, if desired."
